This is a rust project with crates in the crates dir:
pleum: the main code for pleum, contains all the core logic
pleum-cli: the command line interface (binary: pleumcode), uses the pleum crate
pleum-mcp: the mcp servers that ship with pleum. the developer sub system is of special interest

non trivial features should be implemented in the pleum crate and then be called from the pleum-cli crate.

tips:
- can look at unstaged changes for what is being worked on if starting
- always check rust compiles, cargo fmt etc and `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` (as well as run tests in files you are working on)
